      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef compressedString(word: str) -> str:\n    comp = []\n    i = 0\n    n = len(word)\n    \n    while i < n:\n        char = word[i]\n        count = 0\n        # Count consecutive identical characters up to a maximum of 9\n        while i < n and word[i] == char and count < 9:\n            count += 1\n            i += 1\n        \n        # Append the count and the character to the result list\n        comp.append(str(count))\n        comp.append(char)\n        \n    return \"\".join(comp)\n```",
