    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef solve():\n    # Read all input from stdin\n    input_data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    if not input_data:\n        return\n    \n    # First 9 integers are Team Takahashi's runs (A_1 to A_9)\n    # Next 8 integers are Team Aoki's runs (B_1 to B_8)\n    a_runs = [int(x) for x in input_data[:9]]\n    b_runs = [int(x) for x in input_data[9:17]]\n    \n    total_a = sum(a_runs)\n    total_b_so_far = sum(b_runs)\n    \n    # Team Aoki needs to score X such that:\n    # total_b_so_far + X > total_a\n    # X > total_a - total_b_so_far\n    # The smallest integer X is (total_a - total_b_so_far) + 1\n    \n    min_runs_needed = (total_a - total_b_so_far) + 1\n    \n    print(min_runs_needed)\n\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n    solve()\n```",
