      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef minLength(s: str) -> int:\n    stack = []\n    for char in s:\n        if not stack:\n            stack.append(char)\n            continue\n        \n        # Check if the current character forms \"AB\" or \"CD\" with the last character in stack\n        if (stack[-1] == 'A' and char == 'B') or (stack[-1] == 'C' and char == 'D'):\n            stack.pop()\n        else:\n            stack.append(char)\n            \n    return len(stack)\n```",
