      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef is_substring_present(s: str) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if any substring of length 2 in the given string 's' \n    is also present in its reverse.\n    \"\"\"\n    # Get the reversed version of the string\n    reversed_s = s[::-1]\n    \n    # Iterate through the string to find all substrings of length 2\n    for i in range(len(s) - 1):\n        substring = s[i:i+2]\n        # Check if the substring exists in the reversed string\n        if substring in reversed_s:\n            return True\n            \n    return False\n```",
