    "prediction": "gemini-3-flash-preview",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef sumOfTheDigitsOfHarshadNumber(x: int) -> int:\n    # Calculate the sum of digits\n    # Since x <= 100, we can also use sum(int(d) for d in str(x))\n    sum_digits = 0\n    temp = x\n    while temp > 0:\n        sum_digits += temp % 10\n        temp //= 10\n    \n    # Check if x is divisible by the sum of its digits\n    if x % sum_digits == 0:\n        return sum_digits\n    else:\n        return -1\n```",
