      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef solve():\n    # Use fast I/O\n    input_data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    if not input_data:\n        return\n    \n    n = int(input_data[0])\n    t_prime = input_data[1]\n    s_list = input_data[2:]\n    \n    len_t = len(t_prime)\n    possible_indices = []\n    \n    for i in range(n):\n        s = s_list[i]\n        len_s = len(s)\n        \n        # Condition 1 & 4: Same length\n        if len_s == len_t:\n            diff_count = 0\n            for char_s, char_t in zip(s, t_prime):\n                if char_s != char_t:\n                    diff_count += 1\n                if diff_count > 1:\n                    break\n            if diff_count <= 1:\n                possible_indices.append(i + 1)\n                \n        # Condition 2: T' is S with one insertion (len_t = len_s + 1)\n        elif len_t == len_s + 1:\n            si = 0\n            ti = 0\n            diff_found = False\n            while si < len_s:\n                if s[si] == t_prime[ti]:\n                    si += 1\n                    ti += 1\n                elif not diff_found:\n                    diff_found = True\n                    ti += 1\n                else:\n                    break\n            else:\n                # If we finished the loop, it's possible\n                possible_indices.append(i + 1)\n                \n        # Condition 3: T' is S with one deletion (len_t = len_s - 1)\n        elif len_t == len_s - 1:\n            si = 0\n            ti = 0\n            diff_found = False\n            while ti < len_t:\n                if s[si] == t_prime[ti]:\n                    si += 1\n                    ti += 1\n                elif not diff_found:\n                    diff_found = True\n                    si += 1\n                else:\n                    break\n            else:\n                # If we finished the loop, it's possible\n                possible_indices.append(i + 1)\n\n    # Print total count\n    print(len(possible_indices))\n    # Print indices separated by space\n    print(*(possible_indices))\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    solve()\n```",
