    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef accountBalanceAfterPurchase(purchaseAmount: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the account balance after rounding the purchase amount to the \n    nearest multiple of 10. If there is a tie, the larger multiple is chosen.\n    \"\"\"\n    # To round to the nearest 10 with the tie-breaking rule (up),\n    # we can add 5 to the purchase amount and then perform floor division by 10.\n    roundedAmount = ((purchaseAmount + 5) // 10) * 10\n    return 100 - roundedAmount\n```",
