      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef incremovableSubarrayCount(nums):\n    n = len(nums)\n    count = 0\n    \n    # Iterate through all possible subarrays [i, j]\n    for i in range(n):\n        for j in range(i, n):\n            # Form the resulting array after removing subarray nums[i:j+1]\n            remaining = nums[:i] + nums[j+1:]\n            \n            # Check if the remaining array is strictly increasing\n            is_strictly_increasing = True\n            for k in range(len(remaining) - 1):\n                if remaining[k] >= remaining[k+1]:\n                    is_strictly_increasing = False\n                    break\n            \n            if is_strictly_increasing:\n                count += 1\n                \n    return count\n```",
