    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef solve():\n    # Read all input from stdin\n    input_data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    if not input_data:\n        return\n    \n    t = int(input_data[0])\n    results = []\n    \n    for i in range(1, t + 1):\n        n = int(input_data[i])\n        \n        # Vanya (First player) wins on his very first move if:\n        # (n + 1) is divisible by 3 OR (n - 1) is divisible by 3.\n        # This is equivalent to checking if n is not already divisible by 3.\n        # Since the game ends immediately if Vanya makes n divisible by 3,\n        # and he goes first, he wins if n % 3 != 0.\n        # If n is already divisible by 3, any move Vanya makes (n+1 or n-1)\n        # will result in a number not divisible by 3. Vova will then try to \n        # keep the number in a state where Vanya cannot make it divisible by 3 \n        # in one move.\n        \n        if n % 3 != 0:\n            results.append(\"First\")\n        else:\n            results.append(\"Second\")\n            \n    # Print all results joined by newline\n    print('\\n'.join(results))\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    solve()\n```",
