      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef check_similar_strings():\n    # Read input from stdin\n    input_data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    if not input_data:\n        return\n    \n    n = int(input_data[0])\n    s = input_data[1]\n    t = input_data[2]\n    \n    is_similar = True\n    \n    for i in range(n):\n        char_s = s[i]\n        char_t = t[i]\n        \n        # Check if characters are the same\n        if char_s == char_t:\n            continue\n        \n        # Check similarity between '1' and 'l'\n        if (char_s == '1' and char_t == 'l') or (char_s == 'l' and char_t == '1'):\n            continue\n            \n        # Check similarity between '0' and 'o'\n        if (char_s == '0' and char_t == 'o') or (char_s == 'o' and char_t == '0'):\n            continue\n            \n        # If none of the conditions met, they are not similar\n        is_similar = False\n        break\n        \n    if is_similar:\n        print(\"Yes\")\n    else:\n        print(\"No\")\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    check_similar_strings()\n```",
