      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef solve():\n    # Read all input from stdin and split into a list of integers\n    input_data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    \n    if not input_data:\n        return\n    \n    # N is the number of weeks\n    n = int(input_data[0])\n    # A contains the steps for each day (7 * N days total)\n    a = list(map(int, input_data[1:]))\n    \n    weekly_sums = []\n    \n    # Iterate through each week\n    for i in range(n):\n        # Calculate the start and end index for the current week (7 days per week)\n        start_index = i * 7\n        end_index = (i + 1) * 7\n        \n        # Calculate the sum for the specific week\n        current_week_sum = sum(a[start_index:end_index])\n        weekly_sums.append(current_week_sum)\n    \n    # Print the results separated by spaces\n    print(*(weekly_sums))\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    solve()\n```",
