      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef solve():\n    # Read the input string from stdin and remove any trailing whitespace\n    s = sys.stdin.read().strip()\n    \n    if not s:\n        return\n\n    n = len(s)\n    max_len = 1\n\n    # Check every possible substring\n    # i is the starting index, j is the ending index (inclusive)\n    for i in range(n):\n        for j in range(i, n):\n            substring = s[i:j+1]\n            # Check if substring is equal to its reverse\n            if substring == substring[::-1]:\n                length = len(substring)\n                if length > max_len:\n                    max_len = length\n\n    # Print the maximum length found\n    print(max_len)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    solve()\n```",
