      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef lastVisitedIntegers(words):\n    nums = []\n    ans = []\n    consecutive_prev = 0\n    \n    for word in words:\n        if word == \"prev\":\n            consecutive_prev += 1\n            # The (k-1)th index of nums_reverse is the same as\n            # the (len(nums) - k) index of the original nums array\n            index = len(nums) - consecutive_prev\n            if index >= 0:\n                ans.append(int(nums[index]))\n            else:\n                ans.append(-1)\n        else:\n            # When we see a number, reset the consecutive \"prev\" counter\n            consecutive_prev = 0\n            nums.append(word)\n            \n    return ans\n```",
