      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef print_arithmetic_sequence():\n    # Read all input from stdin and split into individual values\n    input_data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    \n    if not input_data:\n        return\n\n    # Parse A, B, and D\n    a = int(input_data[0])\n    b = int(input_data[1])\n    d = int(input_data[2])\n\n    # Generate the sequence using range\n    # range(start, stop, step) is exclusive of stop, so we use b + 1\n    sequence = range(a, b + 1, d)\n\n    # Convert the sequence to strings and join them with spaces\n    print(*(sequence))\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    print_arithmetic_sequence()\n```",
