      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef maxFrequencyElements(nums):\n    \"\"\"\n    Returns the total frequencies of elements in nums such that those elements \n    all have the maximum frequency.\n    \"\"\"\n    from collections import Counter\n    \n    # Count the frequency of each number\n    counts = Counter(nums)\n    \n    # Find the maximum frequency among all elements\n    max_freq = 0\n    for freq in counts.values():\n        if freq > max_freq:\n            max_freq = freq\n            \n    # Sum the frequencies of all elements that have the maximum frequency\n    total_max_frequency = 0\n    for freq in counts.values():\n        if freq == max_freq:\n            total_max_frequency += freq\n            \n    return total_max_frequency\n```",
