    "global index": "MMLUPro_computer science_9087",
    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: The bandwidth of an analog signal is 4kHz. An A/D converter is used to convert the signal from analog to digital. What is the minimum sampling rate for eliminating the aliasing problem? (in kHz)\n\nOptions: \nA. 10\nB. 7\nC. 4\nD. 6\nE. 8\nF. 12\nG. 5\nH. 20\nI. 16\nJ. 2\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
    "prediction": "gemini-3-flash-preview",
    "generated_result": {
