    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Obtain the 15's and 16's complement of the following hexadecimalnumbers: a) FFOb) 1234c) ABCDd) 0000\n\nOptions: \nA. a) 000, b) EDCD, c) 5434, d) 0001\nB. a) FFO, b) 1234, c) ABCD, d) 0000\nC. a) 00F, b) EDDD, c) 5432, d) FFF0\nD. a) 010, b) EECB, c) 6543, d) 000F\nE. a) 00F, b) EDCB, c) 5432, d) FFFF\nF. a) 010, b) EDCC, c) 5433, d) 10000\nG. a) FFF, b) 1234, c) ABCD, d) 0000\nH. a) FFF, b) 1235, c) ABCD, d) 0001\nI. a) 010, b) EDBA, c) 5430, d) FFF1\nJ. a) 001, b) EDBB, c) 5431, d) FFFE\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
