    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: a) 3652_8 × 24_8 b b ) 11.01_2 × 1.01_2 ) 11.01_2 × 1.01_2 c) 5AB_16 × F5A_16\n\nOptions: \nA. 235761_8, 110.1100_2, ABF55C_16\nB. 305214_8, 101.1101_2, 1DF570_16\nC. 172340_8, 111.1101_2, 5AB0F5_16\nD. 987654_8, 101.1010_2, FEDCBA_16\nE. 451236_8, 100.1011_2, 0F5A5B_16\nF. 123456_8, 111.1111_2, ABCDEF_16\nG. 731642_8, 110.1011_2, A55A1F_16\nH. 114510_8, 100.0001_2, 57031D_16\nI. 654321_8, 000.0000_2, 12345F_16\nJ. 146253_8, 101.0110_2, F5A0AB_16\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
