    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: DIMENSION A(10,10,10) Assuming that elements of the array are stored in lexicographic order of their indices, find displacements of the locations of: (a) A(5,6,7)(b) A(10,9,8)(c) A(1,5,9) relative to the location of A(1,1,1).\n\nOptions: \nA. 354, 987, 48\nB. 456, 987, 84\nC. 456, 987, 48\nD. 456, 879, 48\nE. 456, 798, 84\nF. 345, 789, 84\nG. 546, 987, 48\nH. 345, 987, 48\nI. 354, 798, 84\nJ. 546, 879, 84\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
