    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Suppose that a certain software product has a mean time between failures of 10,000 hours and has a mean time to repair of 20 hours. If the product is used by 100 customers, what is its availability?\n\nOptions: \nA. 90%\nB. 97%\nC. 100%\nD. 75%\nE. 85%\nF. 99%\nG. 80%\nH. 95%\nI. 98%\nJ. 99.80%\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
