    "global index": "MMLUPro_computer science_9478",
    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Let a undirected graph G with edges E = {{<2,6>,<2,8>,<2,5>,<6,5>,<5,8>,<6,10>,<10,8>}}, which <A,B> represent Node A is connected to Node B. What is the shortest path from node 2 to node 10? Represent the path as a list.\n\nOptions: \nA. [2, 8, 5, 10]\nB. [2, 5, 6, 8, 10]\nC. [2, 6, 5, 10]\nD. [2, 5, 6, 10]\nE. [2, 6, 8, 10]\nF. [2, 8, 10]\nG. [2, 6, 10]\nH. [2, 5, 8, 10]\nI. [2, 10]\nJ. [2, 8, 5, 6, 10]\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
