    "prediction": "gemini-3-flash-preview",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "The correct answer is **F**.\n\nA double-bind message occurs when there is a contradiction between different levels of communication (such as words versus body language), placing the recipient in a \"no-win\" situation where they cannot respond appropriately to one command without violating the other. In option F, the father's verbal invitation is completely undermined by his non-verbal cues, creating a psychological conflict for the son. The other options represent warnings or expressions of preference rather than true double-binds.\n\n\\boxed{F}",
