    "prompt": "Please read the following question and provide the correct answer.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: This thinker argued that because theoretical statements are not translatable into statements about the immediate objects of experience without a loss of meaningful content, \"descriptivist\" interpretations of theories inevitably collapse into \"instrumentalist\" interpretations.\n\nProvide the correct answer in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct and the most common answer to the question. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
