    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion:  An organization can offer standard products at acceptable levels of quality, yet still generate above-average profit margin by adopting _____________\n\nOptions: \nA. Differentiation.\nB. Cost leadership.\nC. Focus strategy.\nD. Branding strategy.\nE. Growth strategy.\nF. Market penetration strategy.\nG. Diversification strategy.\nH. Market development strategy.\nI. Product development strategy.\nJ. Market follower strategy.\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
