    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion:  Economic—marketing should encourage long-term economic development as opposed to short-term economic development.\n\nOptions: \nA. Economic, emerging, and evolutionary\nB. Evolutionary, experimental, and economic\nC. Ecological, equitable, and economic\nD. Equitable, evolutionary, and emerging\nE. Evolutionary, equitable, and economic.\nF. Economic, equitable, and experimental\nG. Ecological, experimental, and economic\nH. Ecological, equitable, and emerging.\nI. Economic, ecological, and experimental\nJ. Ecological, evolutionary, and economic\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
