    "global index": "MMLUPro_economics_5830",
    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: What do we mean when we say that the farm problem may be cor-rectly envisioned as a problem of resource misallocation?\n\nOptions: \nA. Overproduction and wastage of crops\nB. Lack of alternative employment\nC. Excessive government intervention in agriculture\nD. Inefficient farming methods\nE. Low income of farmers\nF. High tariffs on agricultural imports\nG. Fluctuations in global commodity prices\nH. Suboptimal use of agricultural technology\nI. Environmental degradation due to farming practices\nJ. A significant degree of resource misallocation\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
