    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: \"Economic theory is applicable only to a capitalist society.\" Evaluate.\n\nOptions: \nA. Economic theory is applicable to any system of competition\nB. Economic theory cannot be applied to socialist societies\nC. Economic theory is irrelevant to communist systems\nD. Economic theory is only applicable to capitalist systems\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
