ase and some that supports specific Defense Department or military service needs. As they are housed in the Defense Department, these agencies are keenly attentive to the military's strategic and tactical requirements. \nQuestion: How can the military benefit from the existence of the CIA?\n\nProvided Answer: \n\n Is the provided answer correct? Provide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct choice. ",
